# `is in`, `is not in` and `is between` belong to queries (D99); in an
# ordinary condition they are syntax errors.
numbers are
    1
    2
if 2 is in numbers
    say "in"
while 3 is not in numbers
    say "not in"
if 5 is between 1 and 10
    say "between"
find n in numbers where n is in numbers into found
